# Working files for the unshipped "cosy / stay-warm" filter, and one-off generated
# reports. Same reason as the block above: publish dir is the repo ROOT, so these
# would be fetchable at welly-deals-by-day.co.nz/<file> for no reason.
# NOTE: cosy_candidates.json holds 344 hand-classified deal records. It is genuinely
# useful work, it just should not be a public URL. Back it up somewhere off-repo if
# the cosy filter is going to get built.
